---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";  // NEU
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Privacy Policy - Hero Database</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="privacy-page">
      <header class="privacy-header">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Heroes</a>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      </header>

      <main class="privacy-content">
        <p class="last-updated">Last updated: March 3, 2026</p>

        <section>
          <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to Hero Database ("we", "us", or "our"). This website is a fan-made, community-driven resource for the mobile game "Motto Immortal" developed and published by GOAT Games. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by GOAT Games or any of its subsidiaries.
          </p>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our website and services. By accessing or using Hero Database, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <h3>2.1 Game Data</h3>
          <p>
            The primary purpose of this website is to display publicly available game data from Motto Immortal, including but not limited to hero statistics, skill descriptions, rankings, tier lists, and boss information. This data is sourced from the game itself and does not contain any personal information.
          </p>
          <h3>2.2 Account Registration</h3>
          <p>
            If you choose to create an account on Hero Database, we collect and store your <strong>email address</strong>. This is the only personally identifiable information we require for registration. Your email address is used solely for authentication purposes (logging in to your account). We do not collect your name, phone number, physical address, or any other personal details.
          </p>
          <h3>2.3 User-Generated Data</h3>
          <p>
            When you use account features such as "My Heroes", we store your hero selections, evolution levels, and shared setup configurations. This data is tied to your account and is not personally identifiable on its own.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>To provide and maintain our Service, including account authentication</li>
            <li>To enable personalized features such as hero collection tracking and setup sharing</li>
            <li>To improve and optimize our website</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We will not sell, rent, or share your email address with third parties for marketing purposes. We will not send you promotional emails or newsletters unless you explicitly opt in to such communications.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Log Data</h2>
          <p>
            When you visit our website, our hosting provider may automatically collect certain information sent by your browser ("Log Data"). This Log Data may include your IP address, browser type and version, the pages you visit, the date and time of your visit, and other diagnostic data. This information is collected for security and performance monitoring purposes and is not used to personally identify you.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to maintain your session and authentication state. These cookies are essential for the functioning of account-related features. We do not use cookies for advertising or tracking purposes.
          </p>
          <p>
            You may configure your browser to refuse cookies, but doing so may prevent you from using certain features of our Service that require authentication.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
          <p>We use the following third-party services to operate our website:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Supabase</strong> -- for user authentication and database storage. Your email address and user-generated data are stored on Supabase servers. Supabase's privacy policy applies to data stored on their infrastructure.</li>
            <li><strong>Vercel</strong> -- for website hosting and deployment. Vercel may collect Log Data as described above. Vercel's privacy policy applies to data processed through their platform.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            These third-party providers have access to your information only to perform tasks on our behalf and are obligated not to disclose or use it for other purposes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
          <p>
            We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information. Your email address and account data are stored securely using industry-standard practices provided by our service providers. However, no method of electronic storage or transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
          <p>
            We retain your account data (email address and user-generated data) for as long as your account remains active. If you wish to delete your account and all associated data, please contact me using the information provided below. Upon request, we will permanently delete your personal data from our systems within a reasonable timeframe.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Links to Other Sites</h2>
          <p>
            Our website may contain links to external sites, including but not limited to GOAT Games' official pages and other community resources. We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of these third-party sites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any external sites you visit.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            Our Service is not directed at anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13. If we become aware that a child under 13 has provided us with personal information, we will take steps to delete such information from our servers. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal information, please contact me so we can take appropriate action.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this page periodically. Changes are effective immediately upon posting.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>12. Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            Hero Database is an unofficial fan project. All game content, names, images, and data related to Motto Immortal are the property of GOAT Games. This website is provided "as is" for informational and entertainment purposes only.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>13. Contact me</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal data, please contact me at:
          </p>
          <div class="contact-methods">
            <p><strong>Discord:</strong> ds_frieren</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <span id="contact-email"></span></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <Footer />
    </div>

    <style>
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        min-height: 100%;
        background: radial-gradient(
            ellipse at 30% -10%,
            rgba(120, 90, 200, 0.15),
            transparent 60%
          ),
          radial-gradient(
            ellipse at 80% 20%,
            rgba(255, 215, 100, 0.08),
            transparent 55%
          ),
          linear-gradient(to bottom, #0d0b10, #07060c);
        color: #e6e6eb;
        font-family: Spectral, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      }

      .privacy-page {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .privacy-header {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 64px 24px 32px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .back-link {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
      }

      .back-link:hover {
        color: #facc15;
      }

      .privacy-header h1 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .privacy-content {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 24px;
        flex: 1;
      }

      .privacy-content section {
        margin-bottom: 48px;
      }

      .privacy-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        color: #fff;
      }

      .privacy-content p {
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: rgba(230, 230, 235, 0.85);
        margin: 0 0 12px;
      }

      .privacy-content p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .privacy-content h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 24px 0 8px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      }

      .privacy-content ul {
        margin: 12px 0;
        padding-left: 24px;
        color: rgba(230, 230, 235, 0.85);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .privacy-content ul li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .last-updated {
        text-align: center;
        color: rgba(230, 230, 235, 0.5);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
      }

      .contact-methods {
        margin-top: 8px;
        padding: 16px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .contact-methods a {
        color: #facc15;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
      }

      .contact-methods a:hover {
        opacity: 0.8;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .privacy-header h1 {
          font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .privacy-content h2 {
          font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
      }
    </style>
    <script>
      (function() {
        var u = 'dshuhuk';
        var d = 'gmail.com';
        var el = document.getElementById('contact-email');
        if (el) {
          var addr = u + '@' + d;
          var link = document.createElement('a');
          link.href = 'mailto:' + addr;
          link.textContent = addr;
          el.appendChild(link);
        }
      })();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>